msgstr "Altres versions"

#: index.php:378
msgid "System Requirements:"
msgstr "Requisits del sistema:"

#: index.php:379
msgid "Windows 8 or later."
msgstr "Windows 8 o posterior."

#: index.php:379
msgid "Once downloaded, the application is ready to use."
msgstr "Baixeu-ho i estareu a punt."

#: index.php:380
msgid "Supported Languages:"
msgstr "Idiomes admesos:"

#: index.php:426
msgid ""
"I will take this opportunity to express my gratitude to the translators who "
"made it possible for Rufus, as well as this webpage, to be translated in "
"various languages. If you find that you can use Rufus in your own language, "
"you should really thank them!"
msgstr ""
"Vull expressar la meva gratitud cap als traductors que han fet possible que "
"el Rufus, així com aquesta pàgina web, estiguin disponibles en diverses "
"llengües. Si trobeu que podeu utilitzar el Rufus en la vostra llengua, "
"agraïu-los!"

#: index.php:277 index.php:429
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Utilització"

#: index.php:430
msgid ""
"Download the executable and run it &ndash; no installation is necessary."
msgstr "Baixeu el fitxer executable i obriu-ho; no cal instal·lar-ho."

#: index.php:431
msgid "The executable is digitally signed and the signature should state:"
msgstr "L’executable s’ha signat digitalment; la signatura ha de dir:"

#: index.php:433
msgid "(v1.3.0 or later)"
msgstr "(v1.3.0 o posterior)"

#: index.php:434
msgid "(v1.2.0 or earlier)"
msgstr "(v1.2.0 o anterior)"

#: index.php:436
msgid "Notes on DOS support:"
msgstr "Notes quant a la compatibilitat amb el DOS:"

#: index.php:437
msgid ""
"If you create a DOS bootable drive and use a non-US keyboard, Rufus will "
"attempt to select a keyboard layout according to the locale of your system."
msgstr ""
"Si cregueu una unitat d’arrencada DOS i feu servir un teclat diferent de "
"l’anglès estatunidenc, el Rufus intentarà seleccionar una disposició del "
"teclat adequada per a la configuració local del vostre sistema."

#: index.php:438
msgid "Notes on ISO Support:"
msgstr "Notes quant a la compatibilitat amb ISO:"

#: index.php:439
#, php-format
msgid ""
"All versions of Rufus since v1.1.0 allow the creation of a bootable USB from"
" an <a target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO image</a> (.iso)."
msgstr ""
"Totes les versions del Rufus, des de la 1.1.0, us permeten crear USB "
"d’arrencada a partir d’<a target=\"_blank\" %s>imatges ISO</a> (.iso)."

#: index.php:440
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Creating an ISO image from a physical disc or from a set of files is very "
"easy to do however, through the use of a CD burning application, such as the"
" freely available <a target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> or <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>CDBurnerXP</a>."
msgstr ""
"És senzill crear imatges ISO a partir d’un disc físic o un conjunt de "
"fitxers si utilitzeu un programa d’enregistrament de CD com al <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> o l’<a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>CDBurnerXP</a>, tots dos gratuïts."

#: index.php:443
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)"
msgstr "Preguntes freqüents"

#. You are encouraged to add the translation for " (in English)." after
#. "HERE</a></b>" as the FAQ is only available in English
#: index.php:444
#, php-format
msgid "A Rufus FAQ is available <b><a target=\"_blank\" %s>HERE</a></b>."
msgstr ""
"Hi ha una llista de preguntes freqüents <b><a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>AQUÍ</a></b>."

#: index.php:445
#, php-format
msgid ""
"To provide feedback, report a bug or request an enhancement, please use the "
"GitHub <a target=\"_blank\" %s>issue tracker</a>. Or you can <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>send an e-mail</a>."
msgstr ""
"Si teniu comentaris, voleu informar d’una errada o sol·licitar una millora, "
"feu servir el <a target=\"_blank\" %s>sistema de seguiment d’errades</a> del"
" GitHub. O <a target=\"_blank\" %s>envieu-me un missatge</a> (en anglès)."

#: index.php:448
msgid "License"
msgstr "Llicència"

#: index.php:449
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU General Public License (GPL) version 3</a> or "
"later."
msgstr ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>Llicncia Pública General del GNU (GPL) versió 3</a> "
"o posterior."

#: index.php:449
msgid ""
"You are free to distribute, modify or even sell the software, insofar as you"
" respect the GPLv3 license."
msgstr ""
"Podeu distribuir, modificar o fins i tot vendre el programari si respecteu "
"la llicència GPL v3."

#: index.php:450
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Rufus is produced in a 100%% transparent manner, from its <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>public source</a>, using a <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>MinGW32</a> environment."
msgstr ""
"El Rufus es produeix de manera 100 %% transparent, a partir del <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>codi font públic</a> i en un entorn <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>MinGW32</a>."

#. You are encouraged to append the translation for "(in English)" after
#. "Changelog" as it is only available in English
#: index.php:453
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "Registre de canvis"

#: index.php:279 index.php:485
msgid "Source Code"
msgstr "Codi font"

#: index.php:487
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can clone the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a> repository "
"using:"
msgstr "O bé, podeu clonar el repositori <a target=\"_blank\" %s>Git</a>:"

#: index.php:489
#, php-format
msgid "For more information, see the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>GitHub project</a>."
msgstr ""
"Per a més informació, visiteu el <a target=\"_blank\" %s>projecte a "
"GitHub</a>."

#: index.php:490
msgid ""
"If you are a developer, you are very much encouraged to tinker with Rufus "
"and submit patches."
msgstr ""
"Si sabeu programar, us animem al fet que trastegeu amb el Rufus y envieu "
"pedaços."

#: index.php:280 index.php:493
msgid "Donations"
msgstr "Donatius"

#: index.php:494
msgid ""
"Since I'm getting asked about this on regular basis, there is <b>no</b> "
"donation button on this page."
msgstr ""
"Com que m’ho pregunten gairebé sempre, <b>no</b> hi ha cap botó per donar "
"diners en aquesta pàgina."

#: index.php:495
msgid ""
"The main reason is that I feel that the donation system doesn't actually "
"help software development and worse, can be guilt-inducing for users who "
"choose not to donate."
msgstr ""
"Principalment crec que així no s’ajuda al desenvolupament de programari, i "
"el que és pitjor, pot provocar un sentiment de culpa a els qui trien no fer "
"donatius."

#: index.php:498
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If you really insist, you can always make a donation to the <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>Free Software Foundation</a>, as they are the main "
"reason software like Rufus is possible."
msgstr ""
"Si insistiu, feu un donatiu a la <a target=\"_blank\" %s>Free Software "
"Foundation</a>, que és el motiu principal pel qual programari com el Rufus "
"és possible."

#: index.php:499
msgid ""
"At any rate, I'll take this opportunity to say <i><u>thank you</u></i> for "
"your continuing support and enthusiasm about this little program: it is much"
" appreciated!"
msgstr ""
"En qualsevol cas, vull donar-vos les <i><u>gràcies</u></i> pel vostre suport"
" i entusiasme continuats!"

#: index.php:500
msgid ""
"But please continue to feel free to use Rufus without any guilt about not "
"contributing for it financially &ndash; you should never have to!"
msgstr ""
"No hauríeu de sentir-vos culpable per no contribuir financerament amb aquest"
" programa!"

#: index.php:503
msgid "Non exhaustive list of ISOs Rufus is known to work with"
msgstr "Llista breu de fitxers ISO amb què el Rufus funciona"

